mapping "C499N.1" source="C499N" target="271944004" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source C499N SNOMED CT 271944004 = Clear cell sarcoma at unspecified site (Swedish
        national-extension histology subcode of C49.9). Target 4155072 = Clear cell sarcoma, the
        matching histology concept (clear cell sarcoma of soft tissue / tendons-aponeuroses, excluding
        kidney); source adds only so target subsumes source on site axis (broader). Moderate tier:
        SNOMED CT-browser match on histology, no athena crosswalk at this code (parent C49/C49.9 crosswalk
